# Self-contained on purpose: this directory is copied out and committed as its own repository, and the
# fhevm root .gitignore does not come with it. Nested .gitignore files under sdk/ DO travel with the copy
# and still own their package's build output, so only workspace-wide patterns belong here.
#
# Two patterns from the root file are deliberately NOT repeated: `build/` would hide
# js-sdk/scripts/build/*.mjs, and `public/` would hide rust-sdk/src/decryption/public/*.rs. Both are real
# tracked sources. (`public/` never bit us upstream only because the root writes it as
# `public/ # comment`, and git has no trailing comments, so the pattern never matched anything.)

# Shared tarball output. `npm run pack:tarballs` collects every member's .tgz here so a package
# never has to pack its own predecessor. Owned by this root: only `clean:tarballs` may clear it.
tarballs
.make/

# Dependencies
node_modules

# TypeScript incremental state. Every package emits these; nothing tracks one.
*.tsbuildinfo

# Operating system
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Logs
*.log
*.log.*
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Secrets. The negations must stay after `.env*`, or the committed templates disappear.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample

# Generic build and cache output. `dist/` and `out/` are safe workspace-wide; `build/` is not, see above.
dist/
out/
.cache/
.buildx-cache/
temp/
tmp/

# Forge scratch output from the create2-deploy scripts. Each cleartext generation already ignores these,
# but npm-manifest.json reserves v14 and v15, and a generation added without its own .gitignore would
# otherwise leak them.
.out
.out-*

# Per-generation build output, caches and scratch. Each generation's own .gitignore covers these, but that
# file is tracked only on the branch that owns the generation: switch to a release branch that does not,
# and the generation's directory is still on disk with nothing ignoring it — which is how 404 files of
# v14's tsc output, soldeer dependencies and forge cache were once committed to release/0.13.x, and how two
# vitest result caches under v14/test/ts later surfaced there as an untracked v14/. Every pattern the
# generation file carries is therefore repeated here, so a branch switch can never un-ignore any of them.
# Nothing tracked on any branch matches these.
cache/
dependencies/
broadcast/
**/pkg/ts/_cjs/
**/pkg/ts/_esm/
**/pkg/ts/_types/
**/pkg/ts/_types-cjs/
**/pkg/state/
.vitest-cache/
tarball/
.deploy-config/
.tmp-localhost/
.test-*

# Coverage
coverage/
.nyc_output/
junit/
mochawesome-report/

# Rust
target/

# Archives. `*.tgz` is listed separately because `*.gz` does not match it, and `npm pack` drops one in
# whatever directory it runs from — outside ./tarballs and js-sdk/test/manual-pack, both already covered.
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z
